                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We were also proud to attend the VA Clinic Open House in Lancaster, where vital resources were shared \u2014 covering housing, employment, healthcare, mental health, and dental services.\n\nA powerful reminder of the strength, sacrifice, and unity that define our community. https://t.co/zuODFjtmew",
