                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Medicare and Medicaid support Americans in every corner of our district, from Santa Clarita and Lancaster to Palmdale to the local hospitals and clinics that serve tens of thousands of patients.\n\nI\u2019m fighting to push back against devastating cuts to these programs, and protect the essential health care that families rely on.",
