                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined @ProtectOurCare yesterday to discuss the harm that sweeping Medicaid cuts and a failure to extend the ACA tax credit in the budget will have on our district. 29,000 people in our district will see their premiums skyrocket without ACA tax credits, and even more will lose health insurance altogether as a result of the Medicaid cuts.\u00a0\n\nWe have to get back to Washington and pass a budget to protect these credits, preserve Medicaid, and ensure families can access affordable care.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": [
