                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Yesterday, I attended the Senior Fair in the Santa Clarita Valley to connect with local seniors and share important resources that will help them stay healthy, safe, and independent. From Medicare and Social Security guidance to scam prevention and wellness programs, events like this make a real difference for our older residents.\n\nThank you to the SCV Senior Center, Assemblywoman Pilar Schiavo\u2019s office @AsmPilarSchiavo, and all the partners and volunteers who made today possible.",
