                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Families across the district rely on ACA plans to keep their kids healthy. Programs like Medicaid and CHIP help, but when parents lose ACA support, children often lose coverage too.\n\nThat could mean more families delaying checkups, prescriptions, and preventive care.",
