                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "I came to Congress ready to work with anyone to tackle the cost crisis and make life easier for the hardworking men and women I represent \u2013 unfortunately, the majority has chosen to jam through health care cuts and raise insurance prices, all to give handouts to billionaires.\n\nIf Congress fails to extend the Affordable Care Act tax credits and protect Medicaid funding, hundreds of thousands of my constituents will face increased prices and less accessible health care \u2013 it\u2019s unacceptable.",
